WEBVTT

00:24.858 --> 00:29.612
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

01:58.910 --> 02:00.994
How wonderful...

02:00.995 --> 02:04.415
I still cannot see the limit
of your capabilities.

02:05.083 --> 02:06.376
Same to you.

02:07.043 --> 02:08.545
Show me all you got.

02:09.087 --> 02:13.049
There is at least
one thing I'm certain of.

02:14.134 --> 02:17.303
I have one advantage over you.

02:18.471 --> 02:20.598
And that is the number of means.

02:27.772 --> 02:30.108
<i>This pig hardened again!</i>

02:35.530 --> 02:37.948
Hey, stop trying to be cooler than me!

02:37.949 --> 02:39.491
This isn't the time for that!

02:39.492 --> 02:42.244
Focus! It's regenerating!

02:42.245 --> 02:45.331
Damn it! From which part
is it going to regrow?

02:52.881 --> 02:55.549
Okay, let me summarize things...

02:55.550 --> 02:57.009
I don't want to hear it...

02:57.010 --> 02:59.803
First, this pig just can't die.

02:59.804 --> 03:02.014
Even if we lop its head
and crush its heart,

03:02.015 --> 03:04.850
it'll just regrow
from other parts of its body.

03:04.851 --> 03:06.643
Not to mention, he gets stronger.

03:06.644 --> 03:08.771
I said I didn't want to hear it!

03:09.314 --> 03:12.858
Rozelis could behead it
in a single chop at first,

03:12.859 --> 03:15.528
but now it took all three of us...

03:16.029 --> 03:18.823
It gets stronger the more we kill it...

03:19.324 --> 03:22.326
I Was Reincarnated as the Farm Orc...

03:22.327 --> 03:25.246
...so I Can Take My Time
Destroying The Human Race.

03:32.545 --> 03:34.087
(Farm Orc)

03:34.088 --> 03:37.466
(I Was Reincarnated as the Farm Orc So I Can
Take My Time Destroying The Human Race)

03:37.467 --> 03:39.594
No, no, no!

03:41.054 --> 03:43.847
I don't know how my body works...

03:43.848 --> 03:46.850
Not even my Master knows.

03:46.851 --> 03:50.103
<i>What? So he's not a chimera
made by the Pope?</i>

03:50.104 --> 03:53.608
But that has nothing to do with you.

03:54.609 --> 03:57.362
I'll tenderize you!

04:05.578 --> 04:07.622
<i>Why does this keep happening to me?</i>

04:16.297 --> 04:17.631
Die.

04:17.632 --> 04:19.133
- Babylon!
- Babylon!

04:21.761 --> 04:24.346
Before you kill me, I need to ask.

04:24.347 --> 04:27.516
Why do you hate humans so much?

04:27.517 --> 04:29.811
I want to know how you feel.

04:31.020 --> 04:34.898
You want to hear my history?

04:34.899 --> 04:37.359
Yes, by all means!

04:37.360 --> 04:39.403
Nah, I'm not that interes...!

04:39.404 --> 04:42.948
We are bishops.
We hear the woes of the lost

04:42.949 --> 04:45.909
and guide them back to the right path!

04:45.910 --> 04:49.664
Very well, go ahead
and try to guide me, if you can.

04:50.623 --> 04:53.209
It was several years ago...

04:54.544 --> 04:58.423
I was created by an alchemist.

04:59.674 --> 05:01.425
It's finally complete!

05:01.426 --> 05:04.636
I, the genius Ouroboro,
have crafted my masterpiece!

05:04.637 --> 05:07.431
The pork that will never run out
no matter how much you eat!

05:07.432 --> 05:10.434
Ouroboro-6!

05:10.435 --> 05:12.562
All right, time to cook!

05:16.941 --> 05:20.110
Amazing! You kept regrowing no matter
how many times I chopped you!

05:20.111 --> 05:21.611
It's a success!

05:21.612 --> 05:23.948
And the main body grew bigger
for some reason.

05:24.949 --> 05:28.327
You will be the solution
to world hunger.

05:28.328 --> 05:31.706
Your name is now Mega Meat.
You'll be famous throughout the world!

05:33.207 --> 05:35.876
<i>I was happy.</i>

05:35.877 --> 05:39.087
<i>Happy that I can help people.</i>

05:39.088 --> 05:42.216
<i>Happy that I can make him smile...</i>

05:43.468 --> 05:45.969
Nope! Nobody's going to eat this crap!

05:45.970 --> 05:48.473
<i>At least, until that moment!</i>

05:50.975 --> 05:54.228
Ouroboro-6!

05:55.855 --> 06:00.068
<i>After that, I offered a piece of me
to people at night.</i>

06:01.027 --> 06:04.488
<i>But they all threw up.
All one hundred of them.</i>

06:04.489 --> 06:08.284
<i>When they started spreading rumors
about a "pig monster,"</i>

06:08.993 --> 06:11.245
<i>I realized one thing...</i>

06:11.996 --> 06:14.248
<i>I must've tasted really awful!</i>

06:15.416 --> 06:18.001
<i>Can you imagine how I felt?</i>

06:18.002 --> 06:20.337
<i>I was born to become food,</i>

06:20.338 --> 06:24.008
<i>but I tasted so awful, not even
maggots would eat my meat!</i>

06:24.884 --> 06:28.011
<i>I was in deep despair...</i>

06:28.012 --> 06:30.848
<i>...and that is when I met my Master.</i>

06:46.447 --> 06:48.199
Wonderful.

06:49.408 --> 06:53.703
I can feel the infinitely
regenerating property of your meat.

06:53.704 --> 06:57.959
However, I also tasted
something off in it.

06:58.709 --> 07:01.711
This ability of yours
is not for the sake of humans.

07:01.712 --> 07:05.715
It's a weapon to be used against humans
for treating you like livestock.

07:05.716 --> 07:11.556
Don't let your deeply monstrous heritage
be stained with mankind's selfishness.

07:12.056 --> 07:16.769
<i>He was right.
His words lit a rage inside me.</i>

07:19.230 --> 07:22.732
<i>Yikes... I can't think
of anything nice to say...</i>

07:22.733 --> 07:25.026
I will have my revenge!

07:25.027 --> 07:28.406
Revenge against all the humans
who condemn me as inedible!

07:30.992 --> 07:36.746
I Switched Jobs and Found My Guild Has
No Money so Now I'm Really In Trouble!

07:36.747 --> 07:38.290
(No Money, Real Trouble)

07:38.291 --> 07:41.710
(I Switched Jobs and Found My Guild Has
No Money so Now I'm Really In Trouble)

07:41.711 --> 07:45.047
- Enough already!
- Things are messy enough as it is!

07:46.048 --> 07:49.552
Back then, I would
barely make it every day...

07:50.261 --> 07:54.557
I scoured forests so I
could skimp on food expenses.

07:55.266 --> 07:59.811
It was a time when I had to constantly
look for jobs so we could eat.

07:59.812 --> 08:02.815
Had I met you back then...

08:03.816 --> 08:07.111
I would've embraced you with joy.

08:08.321 --> 08:13.201
A-As if! You only said that because
you don't know how terrible I taste!

08:15.620 --> 08:19.873
I'll do it...
I'll turn you into a pork dish

08:19.874 --> 08:21.333
beloved by everyone!

08:21.334 --> 08:23.127
(Bacond)

08:25.087 --> 08:27.797
How did we end up here?

08:27.798 --> 08:32.260
I started seeing the world in black
and white with how bleak things are...

08:32.261 --> 08:34.305
There's no point
thinking about it, Rozelis.

08:34.972 --> 08:38.141
We're up against an enemy
that we cannot physically beat.

08:38.142 --> 08:42.562
Our only option is to placate it
by turning it into a delicious meal!

08:42.563 --> 08:46.066
Hang on, Thor.
You say delicious meal...

08:46.067 --> 08:50.570
But how are you supposed to make
something with a purplish aura delicious?!

08:50.571 --> 08:54.950
Our job is to do our best and eat
whatever dish is made with that meat!

08:54.951 --> 08:57.327
I knew we'd end up having to eat it!

08:57.328 --> 09:01.748
<i>I don't know what you're planning,
but soon you will learn...</i>

09:01.749 --> 09:05.586
<i>...just how uncookable
my horrifying meat is!</i>

09:06.587 --> 09:10.590
It went "Klonk!"
But it's not frozen, right?! It's raw!

09:10.591 --> 09:13.343
Stay calm!
You're making me freak out!

09:13.344 --> 09:16.721
<i>That's right. Most of all,
my meat is incredibly solid.</i>

09:16.722 --> 09:20.351
<i>What could an amateur chef
like you do?</i>

09:21.102 --> 09:25.605
Don't worry, I know how to deal
with something like this.

09:25.606 --> 09:26.606
What?!

09:26.607 --> 09:30.610
You can't beat it down.
In fact, you do the opposite.

09:30.611 --> 09:33.614
You stroke it softly~

09:34.782 --> 09:36.616
What are you doing?!

09:36.617 --> 09:39.286
A tender caress
doesn't make tender meat!

09:39.287 --> 09:40.495
Wait, look!

09:40.496 --> 09:42.872
The meat is all floppy!

09:42.873 --> 09:43.999
How?!

09:44.000 --> 09:48.295
You get stronger every time you're killed.

09:48.296 --> 09:51.257
So I just have to do the opposite.

09:52.008 --> 09:54.594
I'm so sorry for attacking you like that.

09:55.469 --> 09:56.679
But it's okay now.

09:57.597 --> 09:59.098
No need to be so tough anymore.

10:00.683 --> 10:02.268
<i>Impossible!</i>

10:02.560 --> 10:06.689
<i>The meat... I yielded from that...
Why am I so... cheap?!</i>

10:09.900 --> 10:14.614
<i>I'd praise you
for overcoming its toughness, but...</i>

10:16.782 --> 10:19.784
Babylon, what are you doing?

10:19.785 --> 10:23.288
<i>There is another problem
that causes my awful taste.</i>

10:23.289 --> 10:26.626
<i>And that is the overwhelming stench!</i>

10:27.126 --> 10:30.046
<i>One chef tried to remove
the stink from the meat.</i>

10:30.921 --> 10:34.050
<i>But the amount of scum it produced
made the restaurant go under.</i>

10:35.134 --> 10:37.803
<i>No spices nor chef...</i>

10:40.556 --> 10:43.684
<i>...could ever cut it...</i>

10:45.478 --> 10:46.687
I think...

10:47.396 --> 10:50.190
...I will call this dish the pork cutlet.

10:50.191 --> 10:52.193
You think you'll cut it, huh?!

10:53.235 --> 10:54.819
I hate to admit it, but...

10:54.820 --> 10:58.199
It looks so crispy, delicious, colorful...

10:58.699 --> 11:00.450
Like, really, it's in color.

11:00.451 --> 11:02.452
Then go eat it!

11:02.453 --> 11:04.705
If you can eat it
without throwing up,

11:05.206 --> 11:07.958
then I will reconsider
my vengeance upon humanity.

11:10.336 --> 11:13.421
Look, chew as little as possible
and just swallow it!

11:13.422 --> 11:17.842
<i>How pointless. Trying to lock
the stench inside a thick batter?</i>

11:17.843 --> 11:20.428
<i>If anything, it'll backfire.</i>

11:20.429 --> 11:25.100
<i>All the stench will explode
inside their mouth,</i>

11:25.101 --> 11:27.727
<i>and they will vomit oh so grandly!</i>

11:27.728 --> 11:29.105
Chew it.

11:34.527 --> 11:38.239
<i>I can't stop chewing!
This texture is such a joy to bite!</i>

11:38.739 --> 11:43.243
<i>Not even we bishops can resist
the destructive impulse in our mouths!</i>

11:43.244 --> 11:46.496
<i>So, for naughty bishops like us...</i>

11:46.497 --> 11:48.999
<i>We have no choice but to dive in!</i>

11:49.417 --> 11:54.754
<i>Into the overflowing, juicy flavor!</i>

11:54.755 --> 11:57.508
- It's so good!
- It's so good!

11:58.259 --> 12:00.969
I-Impossible! You're lying!

12:00.970 --> 12:02.512
No, it's really good!

12:02.513 --> 12:06.392
The meat flavor bursts inside my mouth
every time I chew it!

12:06.976 --> 12:10.688
What did you do...?

12:11.772 --> 12:13.524
Before I cooked it...

12:14.275 --> 12:15.943
I just gave it a bit of Glow.

12:19.530 --> 12:22.031
What a tasty-looking pork loin!

12:22.032 --> 12:26.578
Right, a strong purification can turn
the dirtiest sewage into spring water...

12:26.579 --> 12:30.039
Babylon! You're a genius divine sorcerer!

12:30.040 --> 12:34.670
It's not that much.
It was just a small amount of light.

12:35.379 --> 12:37.047
That's how I knew...

12:37.673 --> 12:41.051
Mega Meat, you're actually a good person.

12:42.428 --> 12:47.015
You wished to live to help people, but
you were assaulted with despair instead.

12:47.016 --> 12:49.434
That was what caused
the scum to build in you.

12:49.435 --> 12:52.437
But all of it was erased
with just a little bit of Glow.

12:52.438 --> 12:54.940
Deep down inside, you really are too kind.

12:55.983 --> 13:00.946
You're free to do anything you want,
but don't forget...

13:03.949 --> 13:06.159
It's so good!

13:06.160 --> 13:08.954
The humans also love you now.

13:10.956 --> 13:13.459
No matter how mad I get,

13:14.043 --> 13:17.963
when I see people like this,
I can't get too mad at them anymore.

13:19.006 --> 13:20.840
Thank you for the food!

13:20.841 --> 13:23.928
Share them with the people
in the shelter, okay!

13:28.974 --> 13:31.726
<i>This meat really is a miracle!</i>

13:31.727 --> 13:35.188
<i>By branding it as Rozelis' Mega Meat,
I can solve world hunger,</i>

13:35.189 --> 13:37.732
<i>and gain tons
of worshipers as well!</i>

13:37.733 --> 13:40.401
I've decided!
I'll take good care of that pig!

13:40.402 --> 13:42.738
Babylon, was it?

13:45.991 --> 13:49.744
I want you to purify me.

13:49.745 --> 13:51.871
Wait a second, Mega Meat!

13:51.872 --> 13:56.251
Your regenerative ability most likely
comes from your anger and hatred!

13:56.252 --> 14:00.463
If you get purified, you might turn into
an ordinary pig! What a waste...

14:00.464 --> 14:01.757
I know.

14:02.258 --> 14:06.762
I won't be able to regenerate anymore,
and can only be eaten one last time.

14:07.805 --> 14:11.350
But I want my best part to be eaten...

14:12.643 --> 14:15.145
...by you, Babylon.

14:17.815 --> 14:19.608
<i>I'm sorry, Master...</i>

14:20.401 --> 14:22.027
<i>Professor Ouroboro...</i>

14:22.778 --> 14:25.781
<i>But I want to help people!</i>

14:26.156 --> 14:28.909
<i>I might not be able
to save the world from hunger...</i>

14:31.287 --> 14:36.292
<i>But I want to fill the stomach of
the one person who understood me...</i>

14:37.626 --> 14:38.794
<i>So I...</i>

14:48.345 --> 14:51.557
Right, I did promise you...

14:56.186 --> 14:59.398
No way! How could I possibly eat you?!

15:05.446 --> 15:07.948
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

15:29.178 --> 15:30.679
How impressive.

15:31.180 --> 15:35.059
My Luxa should've cut through
that candlestick without any problem.

15:36.226 --> 15:39.688
And yet it's nigh indestructible
the moment it's in your hands.

15:40.356 --> 15:42.691
It's almost like sorcery.

15:44.401 --> 15:46.861
I highly doubt this,

15:46.862 --> 15:50.491
but are you the mysterious pastor
we were looking for?

15:51.033 --> 15:53.494
Mysterious priest? Oh...

15:54.036 --> 15:55.496
I am not.

15:56.121 --> 15:59.999
My Master is in a realm
far beyond my reach.

16:00.000 --> 16:02.418
Lunar Priestess Anastasia,

16:02.419 --> 16:06.882
even as a bishop, your swordsmanship
certainly lives up to the rumors.

16:07.383 --> 16:13.013
I'm curious about this "Master" who earned
the loyalty of someone as capable as you.

16:13.681 --> 16:17.434
I've heard rumors about you myself,
Silver Blader.

16:18.268 --> 16:23.399
I've heard you immediately vanished right
after rising to an A-rank adventurer.

16:24.608 --> 16:28.028
Why pick being a mere maid
instead of an adventurer?

16:30.698 --> 16:32.323
You don't have to answe...

16:32.324 --> 16:33.659
Because I met him.

16:35.077 --> 16:38.788
The one I'm destined to be with.

16:38.789 --> 16:41.041
<i>That was totally not what I expected.</i>

16:43.627 --> 16:47.047
It seems we both have reasons not to lose.

16:47.548 --> 16:49.216
For our respective masters.

16:50.551 --> 16:52.803
Luxa - Lunar Spectrum.

16:53.637 --> 16:54.929
<i>A multi-colored mist?!</i>

16:54.930 --> 16:57.057
Midnight Sun.

16:57.725 --> 16:59.309
Fickle Fog!

16:59.935 --> 17:01.937
<i>Rainbow-colored giants...</i>

17:02.438 --> 17:04.939
<i>No, I mustn't be fooled.</i>

17:04.940 --> 17:09.444
<i>This is an illusion seen at high places
created by lights and shadows.</i>

17:09.445 --> 17:12.448
<i>In other words, they're only shadows!</i>

17:16.076 --> 17:19.455
<i>They're not shadows?!
This whole fog is Luxa!</i>

17:23.208 --> 17:26.919
<i>There are too many of them
for me to block at once.</i>

17:26.920 --> 17:28.797
<i>This candlestick will not last.</i>

17:29.048 --> 17:31.299
<i>Anastasia won't show any opening.</i>

17:31.300 --> 17:34.720
<i>She is waiting until my weapon
and I myself are depleted.</i>

17:35.429 --> 17:38.598
<i>But that is when
she will let her guard down.</i>

17:38.599 --> 17:40.726
<i>The fight will be decided in an instant.</i>

17:43.771 --> 17:45.189
<i>The Silver Blader...</i>

17:46.440 --> 17:50.235
<i>So noble and beautiful...
All for her Master's sake.</i>

17:50.736 --> 17:53.489
<i>She truly is a wonderful, loyal servant.</i>

17:54.948 --> 17:56.742
<i>As a fellow servant...</i>

17:57.493 --> 17:59.453
<i>...you are far too bright.</i>

18:00.871 --> 18:04.124
<i>While I... am ugly and filthy...</i>

18:06.126 --> 18:09.630
We'll go get some nice food...

18:10.255 --> 18:12.716
<i>I was the cause of my Master's insanity.</i>

18:14.218 --> 18:15.469
Anastasia.

18:16.470 --> 18:19.098
I hold no resentment toward you.

18:19.765 --> 18:22.434
If you wish to leave,
now would be the time.

18:24.394 --> 18:27.022
<i>The time to leave has long passed.</i>

18:27.731 --> 18:31.276
<i>Master Guitane,
I am staying by your side.</i>

18:32.903 --> 18:36.406
<i>Even if that is
not what you wished for.</i>

18:37.407 --> 18:39.242
<i>I heard it.</i>

18:39.243 --> 18:45.666
<i>The candlestick in your hand can't even
be used as a rod at this point.</i>

18:46.291 --> 18:50.921
<i>At the very least,
I will take your life with my own hands.</i>

19:11.650 --> 19:13.443
Dragonic Moon-Eater!

19:27.749 --> 19:30.627
Why didn't you kill me...?

19:32.045 --> 19:36.508
You purposely made your Luxa dull...

19:37.384 --> 19:43.765
I had no idea that
you could use Divine Sorcery...

19:44.266 --> 19:48.770
This is a gift from my Master.

19:49.938 --> 19:51.772
What is this marble?

19:51.773 --> 19:55.526
It has the mana signature
of a Luxa inscribed on it.

19:55.527 --> 20:00.781
If you hold it and send mana into it,
you can materialize your Luxa.

20:00.782 --> 20:03.326
I-I am happy beyond belief,

20:03.327 --> 20:06.287
but I'm not confident
in my ability in sorcery...

20:06.288 --> 20:08.789
Perhaps I could make
more use of an actual sword.

20:08.790 --> 20:13.044
There's a possibility your weapon will be
taken away by the rules of the church.

20:13.045 --> 20:17.382
Lloyd! Let's practice our songs!

20:17.925 --> 20:20.676
Either way, I don't mind
if you don't use it.

20:20.677 --> 20:21.929
P-Prince Lloyd!

20:27.059 --> 20:28.685
Thank you very much!

20:31.355 --> 20:36.985
My Master is wise... Heroic... Adorable...

20:37.736 --> 20:40.405
But he can be so wrong at times.

20:41.156 --> 20:44.076
And he makes quite the funny face
when I scold him.

20:45.702 --> 20:47.913
He is a man of many secrets.

20:48.789 --> 20:54.962
But I will wait until he chooses
to reveal the truth himself.

20:55.837 --> 20:57.546
<i>I've run out of my mana...</i>

20:57.547 --> 21:02.760
<i>I can't believe how few mana I can muster.
All it took was a single sword...</i>

21:02.761 --> 21:04.137
I...

21:05.138 --> 21:07.891
I couldn't bring myself
to ever reprimand my Master...

21:10.018 --> 21:14.189
<i>But perhaps that is
what Master wishes for...</i>

21:15.107 --> 21:17.401
<i>For someone to stop him...</i>

21:21.780 --> 21:22.698
But...

21:23.782 --> 21:25.200
I can't...

21:28.954 --> 21:33.250
My voice... can't reach him...

21:35.210 --> 21:40.590
A cold, dark void, like a stormy night
with not a single star in sight.

21:41.091 --> 21:43.802
That is the state of his heart...

21:44.970 --> 21:47.764
Ever since that day...

21:49.516 --> 21:53.478
At most, I am just a hazy moon...

21:56.481 --> 22:01.111
As a mere maid,
I have no right to judge you.

22:04.031 --> 22:05.782
Though I do hope...

22:08.201 --> 22:11.580
That in this battle...

22:13.498 --> 22:15.500
Someone's voice...

22:16.335 --> 22:18.670
...will reach your Master's heart.

23:51.721 --> 23:54.932
<i>Unfortunately, even if you
defeat me, Anastasia,</i>

23:54.933 --> 23:58.894
<i>it will not stop this kingdom
from being consumed by darkness.</i>

23:58.895 --> 24:00.813
<i>Next time, on Episode 22:</i>

24:00.814 --> 24:02.273
<i>Black Dragon.</i>

